{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>For a fire went out from Heshbon.</b> An allusion to the men who conspired in Heshbon against their king." "<b>A flame.</b> Its meaning is doubled, as is the rule." "<b>The city of Sihon.</b> A city that today belongs to Sihon." "<b>Ar of Moab.</b> The name of a nearby place, like \"from Bethlehem of Judah.\"" "<b>Bamoth.</b> High places."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:43.236896590Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}